      Input=(Expression="/Script/Engine.MaterialExpressionTextureSampleParameter2D'V5_M_FoamStateUpdate:MaterialExpressionTextureSampleParameter2D_2'",Mask=1,MaskR=1,MaskG=1,MaskB=1)
